    "name": "gRPC-Web Proxy Reflection API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "OpenAPI specification for gRPC-Web proxy endpoints. gRPC-Web is a JavaScript client library that enables browser-based applications to communicate with gRPC services through an intermediary proxy. The proxy translates HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2 requests into native gRPC calls, exposing health checking, reflection, and channelz services over RESTful HTTP endpoints.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: gRPC Authors",
